# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `wrangler dev` in this directory.
# Never commit the real file.

# This agent only VERIFIES inbound WorkOS M2M tokens (against
# WORKOS_M2M_CLIENT_ID in wrangler.jsonc, via JWKS) — it never mints one, so
# it needs no client secret of its own. Any caller (the Kweli MCP, or another
# Nyuchi/Mukoko app) mints its own token using THIS agent's client_id/secret
# pair, which lives in the caller's secrets, distinct from bulk-place-agent's.

# No secrets required yet — this agent is a stub (see agent-do.ts's TODO for
# what the real Overpass/Nominatim/write-records implementation will need,
# e.g. MONGODB_URI once it starts writing places).
